rule: ELIM-G-19
ack is unfolded on the literal m it matches on; the whistle stops at the
recursive call with the same m, which is specialized, keeping the literal
that repeats. count, called with a literal, unfolds completely.
CHECK-DAG: -- specialization of Main.ack(3:Int; _:Int)
CHECK-DAG: -- specialization of Main.ack(2:Int; _:Int)
CHECK-DAG: -- specialization of Main.ack(1:Int; _:Int)
CHECK-NOT: Main.count
rule: ELIM-G-19
